{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLElementPositionV7elementSSSgvp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"element","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"element"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition","title":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element and position attributes are new as of Version 2.0. They allow for bookmarks and links to be"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"positioned at higher resolution than the level of music-data elements. When no element and position attributes"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are present, the bookmark or link element refers to the next sibling element in the MusicXML file. The element"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"attribute specifies an element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bookmark. The position attribute specifies the position of this descendant element, where the first position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is 1. The position attribute is ignored if the element attribute is not present. For instance, an element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value of “beam” and a position value of “2” defines the link or bookmark to refer to the second beam","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark. This is equivalent to an XPath test of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[.\/\/beam[2]] done in the context of the sibling element.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition/element":{"kind":"symbol","title":"element","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark."}]}}}